<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 5.81 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 5.81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 5.81 percent on Thursday from 6.15 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said six banks traded on the market in 15 reported transactions with a total value of 24.62 million dinars ($34.7 million). -- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
